# Compare dielectric IOR, rough transmission, absorption, subsurface and conductor presets.
# Path tracing is enabled by the project renderer settings; allow accumulation to converge.
# The labeled rows and checker background reveal refraction and transmission differences.
# Edit each sphere or slab material to compare roughness, thickness and scattering.
# Closed dielectric boundaries and a local fog volume also exercise medium transitions.

